  - question: How many downspouts does my Somerville home need?
    answer: "<p>Generally, one downspout for every 20-30 feet of gutter run. We can quickly assess and tell you if you're under-served.</p>"
  - question: What size downspouts are best for Somerville?
    answer: "<p>We often recommend 3x4 inch downspouts instead of standard 2x3 inch for better capacity in Morgan County's heavy rainfall.</p>"
  - question: How far should downspouts extend from my house?
    answer: "<p>At least 4-6 feet from your foundation. For rural properties with challenging drainage, underground drains route water even farther.</p>"
  - question: Can you add downspouts to existing gutters?
